"1:43.543">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">現</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.543" end="1:43.760">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.760" end="1:43.973">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.973" end="1:44.480">つ</span></span></span><span begin="1:44.480" end="1:44.740">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">交</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:44.740" end="1:45.193">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:45.193" end="1:45.440">じ</span></span></span><span begin="1:45.440" end="1:45.700">え</span><span begin="1:45.700" end="1:45.960">て</span><span begin="1:45.960" end="1:46.220">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">梦与现交错之地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yume to utsutsu to majiete wa</span></p><p begin="1:46.400" end="1:50.700" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.400" end="1:46.660">きょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.660" end="1:46.943">う</span></span></span><span begin="1:46.943" end="1:47.403">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:47.403" end="1:47.660">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:47.660" end="1:47.880">わ</span><span begin="1:47.880" end="1:48.120">り</span><span begin="1:48.120" end="1:48.340">な</span><span begin="1:48.340" end="1:48.600">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">町</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.600" end="1:49.060">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:49.060" end="1:49.343">ち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">角</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:49.343" end="1:49.603">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:49.603" end="1:49.800">ど</span></span></span><span begin="1:49.800" end="1:50.700">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在从未改变的街区之一隅</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyō mo kawari naku machikado ni</span></p><p begin="1:49.800" end="1:50.750" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">華</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:49.800" end="1:50.060">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.060" end="1:50.260">な</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">散</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.260" end="1:50.620">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.620" end="1:50.750">る</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">花落如缤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hana chiru</span></p><p begin="1:50.760" end="1:54.100" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">口伝伝承</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.760" end="1:51.293">む</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.293" end="1:51.450">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.450" end="1:51.773">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.773" end="1:52.000">ば</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.000" end="1:52.153">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.153" end="1:52.513">し</span></span></span><span begin="1:52.513" end="1:52.960">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">祀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.960" end="1:53.140">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.140" end="1:53.440">つ</span></span></span><span begin="1:53.440" end="1:53.700">れ</span><span begin="1:53.700" end="1:54.100">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只愿交口相传的故事延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mukashibanashi o matsureba</span></p><p begin="1:54.433" end="1:57.840" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.433" end="1:54.660">め</span><span begin="1:54.660" end="1:55.120">で</span><span begin="1:55.120" end="1:55.360">た</span><span begin="1:55.360" end="1:55.640">き</span><span begin="1:55.640" end="1:55.900">も</span><span begin="1:55.900" end="1:56.120">の</span><span begin="1:56.120" end="1:56.340">は</span><span begin="1:56.340" end="1:56.840">こ</span><span begin="1:56.840" end="1:57.080">れ</span><span begin="1:57.080" end="1:57.320">に</span><span begin="1:57.320" end="1:57.533">あ</span><span begin="1:57.533" end="1:57.840">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如画般的景致就在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">medetaki mono wa kore ni ari</span></p><p begin="1:58.020" end="2:01.700" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:58.020" end="1:58.280">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:58.280" end="1:58.500">め</span></span></span><span begin="1:58.500" end="1:59.040">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">現</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:59.040" end="1:59.220">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:59.220" end="1:59.463">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:59.463" end="1:59.980">つ</span></span></span><span begin="1:59.980" end="2:00.240">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">交</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.240" end="2:00.720">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.720" end="2:00.940">じ</span></span></span><span begin="2:00.940" end="2:01.180">え</span><span begin="2:01.180" end="2:01.440">て</span><span begin="2:01.440" end="2:01.700">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">梦与现交错之际</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yume to utsutsu to majiete wa</span></p><p begin="2:01.880" end="2:08.560" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幻想郷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:01.880" end="2:02.160">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.160" end="2:02.420">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.420" end="2:02.800">ろ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.800" end="2:03.380">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.380" end="2:03.600">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.600" end="2:03.860">く</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.860" end="2:04.223">に</span></span></span><span begin="2:04.223" end="2:04.980">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遊</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.303" end="2:05.470">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.470" end="2:05.803">そ</span></span></span><span begin="2:05.803" end="2:06.020">ぶ</span><span begin="2:06.020" end="2:06.280">が</span><span begin="2:06.280" end="2:07.420">い</span><span begin="2:07.420" end="2:08.560">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只消畅玩于幻想乡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">maboroshi no kuni ni asobu ga ii</span></p><p begin="2:13.700" end="2:17.300" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.700" end="2:14.040">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:14.040" end="2:14.240">ら</span></span></span><span begin="2:14.240" end="2:14.740">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">踊</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:14.740" end="2:15.000">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.000" end="2:15.240">ど</span></span></span><span begin="2:15.240" end="2:15.680">る</span><span begin="2:15.680" end="2:15.960">も</span><span begin="2:15.960" end="2:16.200">の</span><span begin="2:16.200" end="2:16.460">が</span><span begin="2:16.460" end="2:16.920">い</span><span begin="2:16.920" end="2:17.300">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">有人于凌空起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sora de odoru mono ga iru</span></p><p begin="2:17.640" end="2:21.220" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">怪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.640" end="2:17.880">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.880" end="2:18.160">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">異</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.160" end="2:18.400">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:18.400" end="2:18.580">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">使役</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.580" end="2:18.880">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.880" end="2:19.080">か</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.080" end="2:19.320">う</span><span begin="2:19.580" end="2:19.840">も</span><span begin="2:19.840" end="2:20.060">の</span><span begin="2:20.060" end="2:20.300">が</span><span begin="2:20.300" end="2:20.800">い</span><span begin="2:20.800" end="2:21.220">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">有人将怪异使役</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kaii o tsukau mono ga iru</span></p><p begin="2:21.413" end="2:27.640" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.413" end="2:21.760">そ</span><span begin="2:21.760" end="2:22.000">れ</span><span begin="2:22.000" end="2:22.460">ら</span><span begin="2:22.460" end="2:22.720">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">真</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.720" end="2:23.200">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">似</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.200" end="2:23.460">ね</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.460" end="2:24.060">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">子</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.400" end="2:24.693">こ</span></span></span><span begin="2:24.693" end="2:24.900">ら</span><span begin="2:24.900" end="2:25.160">が</span><span begin="2:25.160" end="2:25.640">い</span><span begin="2:25.640" end="2:27.640">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">有一群孩子向她们比拟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sorera o maneru kora ga iru</span></p><p begin="2:29.213" end="2:32.900" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">拙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:29.213" end="2:29.513">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:29.513" end="2:29.773">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:29.773" end="2:30.040">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:30.040" end="2:30.260">い</span><span begin="2:30.260" end="2:30.500">も</span><span begin="2:30.500" end="2:30.720">の</span><span begin="2:30.720" end="2:31.020">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.180" end="2:31.463">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.463" end="2:31.700">も</span></span></span><span begin="2:31.700" end="2:31.940">え</span><span begin="2:31.940" end="2:32.380">ど</span><span begin="2:32.380" end="2:32.900">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">虽然尚显笨拙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsutanai mono to omoedomo</span></p><p begin="2:33.013" end="2:36.760" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.013" end="2:33.360">そ</span><span begin="2:33.360" end="2:33.580">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:33.580" end="2:33.863">て</span></span></span><span begin="2:33.863" end="2:34.100">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">握</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.100" end="2:34.353">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.353" end="2:34.580">ぎ</span></span></span><span begin="2:34.580" end="2:34.920">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">其</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.980" end="2:35.300">そ</span></span></span><span begin="2:35.300" end="2:35.540">れ</span><span begin="2:35.540" end="2:35.760">こ</span><span begin="2:35.760" end="2:36.280">そ</span><span begin="2:36.280" end="2:36.760">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">但此刻他们手握之物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono te ni nigiru sore koso ga</span></p><p begin="2:36.980" end="2:42.920" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.980" end="2:37.213">い</span><span begin="2:37.213" end="2:37.503">つ</span><span begin="2:37.503" end="2:38.013">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幻</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.013" end="2:38.130">げ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.130" end="2:38.370">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">想</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.370" end="2:38.710">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.710" end="2:38.960">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:38.960" end="2:39.500">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.840" end="2:40.160">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:40.160" end="2:40.360">ん</span><span begin="2:40.360" end="2:40.640">で</span><span begin="2:40.640" end="2:41.080">い</span><span begin="2:41.080" end="2:42.920">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">终有一日，会将幻想孕育</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsuka gensō o unde iku</span></p><p begin="2:44.323" end="2:46.420" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.323" end="2:44.720">さ</span><span begin="2:44.720" end="2:45.020">あ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">詠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.020" end="2:45.500">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.500" end="2:45.960">た</span></span></span><span begin="2:45.960" end="2:46.420">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">来吧，歌唱吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sā utae</span></p><p begin="2:46.420" end="2:48.860" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">舞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.420" end="2:46.700">ま</span></span></span><span begin="2:46.700" end="2: