42.093">き</span><span begin="3:42.093" end="3:42.340">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在传说的梦之国度生活</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">densetsu no yume no kuni ni ikite</span></p><p begin="3:42.340" end="3:45.500" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:42.340" end="3:42.580">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:42.580" end="3:42.843">き</span><span begin="3:42.843" end="3:43.100">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:43.100" end="3:43.560">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:43.560" end="3:43.800">き</span><span begin="3:43.800" end="3:45.500">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">居住成长</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ikite ikite</span></p><p begin="3:46.660" end="3:49.860" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">明日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.660" end="3:46.833">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.833" end="3:47.200">す</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:47.200" end="3:47.403">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="3:47.403" end="3:47.660">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">町</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:47.660" end="3:47.880">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:47.880" end="3:48.140">ち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">角</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.140" end="3:48.360">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.360" end="3:48.580">ど</span></span></span><span begin="3:48.580" end="3:48.860">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">片</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.860" end="3:49.080">か</span><